You can install insomnia, httpie (http and https), newman, and schemathesis on Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) with these commands.

1. Install insomnia (Snap) & newman (npm)

bash
sudo snap install insomnia && \
sudo npm install -g newman
Use code with caution.

2. Install httpie (http / https) & schemathesis (pipx)

bash
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y pipx && \
pipx ensurepath && \
pipx install httpie && \
pipx install schemathesis
Use code with caution.

3. Verify All API Testing Tools Are Installed & Ready

bash
export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:/snap/bin:/usr/local/bin:$PATH"

for tool in postman insomnia http https curl newman schemathesis; do
  if command -v "$tool" >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    echo "✅ $tool -> $(command -v "$tool")"
  else
    echo "❌ $tool -> MISSING"
  fi
done

echo "--- Functional Check ---"
http --version
newman --version
schemathesis --version
Use code with caution.
